WEBVTT

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.350
I've never done it before, but I'll do it now.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.180
I've got to be kidding...

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:22.910
Shyness and bewilderment, should I add up those experiences?

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.030
Even if I've seen some things, I'll turn a blind eye to them.

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:27.750
They disappear with a flicker.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.840
The strong afterimage really has little effect.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:38.160
I unintentionally blurt out, "I kind of like you."

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.490
I have a temperature and a cold coming on.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.940
It's no-no-normal.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:48.730
When the contradictions come to an end, a white horse appears.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:51.440
How strange! How strange!

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:54.780
You look like the prince!

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.530
The regret from the kiss won't disappear.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:02.850
Why did you give it to me even though it's just puppy love?

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.190
Let's start over again.

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:08.210
It's not over. The kiss was passionate.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:12.270
It was just too sudden, so what should we do?

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:15.830
Quickly, the horse from before...

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:17.510
Should we ride away?

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:18.890
Just the two of us?

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:19.930
And then leave it?

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:21.560
No, no, no.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:27.810
What I really want is for us to make a secret plan!

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:51.130
Eventually, I...

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:54.610
will be gone in the evening.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:55.900
I'm not needed anymore.

00:01:56.620 --> 00:02:01.000
I will merely become trash.

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:05.140
I just... want to be loved, and yet...

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.810
Who would find me?

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.260
Welcome!

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:17.320
Thank you very much. Please come again!

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:23.710
As long as he has money, you will open for anyone.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.700
You're such a bad girl, in other words.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.570
Hey! Where's my change?!

00:02:28.570 --> 00:02:31.750
What's wrong with this thing?! Hey!

00:02:55.870 --> 00:03:01.360
Damn! That stupid vending machine... It treated me like a fool because I'm a virgin.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.330
Daichi Kakeru, 16 years old,

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.890
has been without a girlfriend for 16 years!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.920
Will one fall from somewhere? A docile and cute girlfriend...

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:46.530
My first kiss... tasted like melon soda.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:18.770
Was it you? You're...

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.090
Idiot!

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:32.450
Why are you naked?

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.000
Hey, where did you come from?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.330
Huh? N-No. Just now I kissed...

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.670
A girl came to my room alone?

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:47.950
A girl is in front of me, someone without a girlfriend for 16 years...

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:54.480
I see. This is a dream.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:57.980
W-Wait. Hurry and cover that.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.970
Although it's a dream, it's pretty rare to have this kind of opportunity.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:13.840
If I don't take action effectively, it would hurt my pride as a man.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.800
I see. I see. This doesn't feel like a dream at all.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:22.340
Then, let's lick next.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:25.470
Where is good? Hey, where? Where is good?

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.480
You...

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.890
Pervert!

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.240
Excuse me, Otoya-san.

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:58.210
Yes... Good work, Airin-kun.

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:02.140
It's Kizaki. Please don't call me by my first name.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:07.220
A moment ago, the appearance of a new steel Akikan was confirmed.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:13.280
The location is the Hamachi wooden apartment,

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.710
in the room of a male high school student who is living alone.

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:17.680
Male high school student...

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:21.770
Yes. His name is... Daichi Kakeru.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.270
Kakeru-kun?

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:30.200
Do you get it now?

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:35.620
The thing I just threw at you was compressed carbon dioxide from inside me.

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:38.660
Carbon dioxide gas? Compressed?

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:43.960
It's Refreshing Beverage Magic. Yes, I am a melon soda can.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:49.910
By touching your lips, I turn into a human form.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.550
So, you are my...

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:59.140
Okay, Miss. Let me think through this calmly.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.670
Before that, cover your front!

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:04.420
The situation is like this.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:08.170
In the room of a man who lives alone, a mysterious girl suddenly appears.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:09.890
That's not the point.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:12.990
Then, their lips meet.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.700
No!

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.890
That girl said that she's a melon soda can.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.730
What are you doing?!

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:23.710
In other words, the truth behind this mystery is...

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:26.870
The naked detective Daichi Kakeru's conclusion is...

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.210
This is a dream!

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:31.010
The sixth sense of my loins tells me that this is a dream...

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.630
H-Hey. Hey!

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:36.050
What are these? Do you collect empty cans?

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:41.370
Yeah, I collect rare and limited edition cans.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:45.270
You put value in the cans.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:48.400
What is this? Aren't these aluminum cans?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.920
This too. This one too?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:53.200
I'm a steel can. Aluminum cans are...

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:57.090
It's show time!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.870
Idiot!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.700
What's wrong with you?

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:11.630
This is a dream! It's a dream! A dream...

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:11.630
A dream, you say?

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.200
Is this also...

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:18.230
a dream?

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:30.110
Un-Unbelievable. What sort of a magic trick is this?

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.320
That's not it!

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:34.610
Where? Where are you hiding?

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.980
Below you. Look down.

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:42.540
You pulled the tab on my ear, and I turned back into this form.

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:46.250
Where? Where did you hide the speakers?

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.510
It's not like that! I'm speaking directly into your head.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.180
Open the door, Daichi Kakeru-kun.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.360
You're not going to open it?

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:08.250
Then I have no choice. Do it, Airin-kun.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:09.690
I'm Kizaki.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:20.120
What are you so afraid of, Kakeru-kun?

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.070
My name is Otoya Hidehiko.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:27.620
I'm a government official from the Department of Finance.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.580
Go-Government official...

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.590
Oh...

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.590
I see. So that was your intention.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:39.760
Are you provoking me with that clothing?

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:46.140
We are here to talk about you and your Akikan.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.610
Currently the government is researching cans' turning into girls,

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.630
more commonly known as the project "Akikan"—

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.310
Otoya-san.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.180
He's... not listening.

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:06.000
It can't be helped. As I thought, I should deepen our friendship...

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.180
Please stop it.

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:08.630
What are you talking about?

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:15.880
You really want to fully use his body as you like and enjoy it heartily, don't you?

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:19.260
I would never think of such a thing.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:22.070
Oh, is it that...

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:23.910
things like girls are boring?

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:24.690
I don't know!

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:32.290
We will talk about this another time.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.940
Excuse us.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:43.660
Who were they? Why must that girl be taken away before I lose my virginity.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:45.030
Damn.

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:47.160
W-Wait!

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:09.230
If you're going to drink me, tell me beforehand. Idiot.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.020
The can turned into a girl again.

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:13.750
You're named Kakeru, right?

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.320
Y-Yeah...

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:19.100
Kakeru, I will be living here from now on.

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:25.030
It's only natural. Although it was an accident, you became my owner.

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:27.070
Owner?

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:28.990
What? Do you have a problem with that?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.740
Good morning.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.660
Kakeru-chan, good morning.

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:07.070
Oh, it's Najimi.

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:09.790
What's wrong? Is there something troubling you?

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.010
If that's the case, you can discuss it with Najimi.

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:16.830
Najimi is your childhood friend, after all.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:20.900
Najmi, do you know about a man's romance?

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.780
Man's romance?

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.300
Yes.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:27.050
It's to live together with a beautiful girl and make love with her.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:32.950
Kakeru-chan, you want to do that with Najimi?

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:38.960
That is a man's everlasting dream.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.380
It's the same as a child's asking his parents for toys.

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:42.940
T-Toys?

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:46.320
But, if it's Kakeru-chan...

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.300
But, but...

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:53.220
Why isn't she a normal human being?

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:54.830
Not normal?!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:13:00.280
She has a nice face, yet she's also selfish, self-centered, and violent.

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:03.080
That's mean... That's mean, Kakeru-chan!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:07.260
Najimi isn't that kind of girl! I'm not violent!

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:10.500
Hey, Tenkuji is crying.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.600
Did Daichi Kakeru force himself on her?

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.340
What a lowlife...

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.870
Why is Tenkuji-san crying?

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:24.170
Hey. Hey!

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:26.850
Oh, who are you?

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:29.950
It's me! Me! It's Gigolo!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.200
Didn't we meet yesterday?

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.130
Gigolo?

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:38.680
Why does someone as simple and unremarkable as you have a French nickname?

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:41.190
Did you give it to yourself?

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:46.220
You said it yourself, right? My name is Amaji Goro and that's why you named me Gigolo.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.700
Najimi is crying!

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.230
You just noticed it?

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:53.450
Why is she crying?

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.150
That card is...

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.410
It's the cursed card that can even cut through an Adamantium sword.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.650
She's coming! She's coming!

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:10.610
Hates men and loves women... It's the witch resurrected in our current day...

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:12.660
Kochikaze Yurika!

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:22.050
It's fine now, Najimi. I'll help sterilize the campylobacter that follow you about.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.420
You, Kochikaze! What are you doing?

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:28.540
You too, what did you do?

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:34.600
You made my beautiful Najimi, a goddess descended to Earth, cry.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:37.170
What is Kochikaze-san doing?

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:41.380
In the name of the witch, Daichi Kakeru...

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:44.410
Rot with the devil in the depths of hell!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:53.200
What were you thinking? Idiot.

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:56.740
Why didn't you drink me this morning?

00:14:56.740 --> 00:15:01.000
If you don't drink me, my existence will be meaningless, won't it? Wait!

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:04.270
As I thought, I hear her.

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:07.000
Why a can? Why an inorganic thing?!

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.490
Hurry and drink me!

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:15.220
To be honest, I am very scared to drink you.

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:22.940
If I touch your lips, you will turn into a girl again.

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.050
What are you doing? Idiot!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.770
Why don't you drink from the can?!

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:34.510
I'm a can! If you use a cup, what purpose do I serve?

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:36.700
I know, I know. Stop shouting.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:41.870
Then, I'm going to drink you.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:56.830
H-Hey, somehow you're acting strange.

00:15:56.830 --> 00:16:01.540
The juice is my life source. If it runs out...

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.020
Huh! Then why did you tell me to drink it?

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:10.990
I exist for people to drink the juice, so...

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:14.020
If I drink all of the juice, will you die?

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:17.350
It's all right. If you refill me with the same juice...

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:18.960
I get it!

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:23.330
Thank you very much. Please come again!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:26.960
But, now that I think about it, why did I become her gofer?

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:30.130
Thank you very much. Please come again!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:41.160
I bought it especially for you, and not even one courtesy.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:45.060
Where have all the beautiful Japanese hearts gone?

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.670
At times like this, I can't stand not drinking.

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:52.800
Wait, why did you buy that juice?

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:55.070
Don't drink any juices other than me.

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:59.270
Do you want to be drank by me?

00:16:59.270 --> 00:17:02.580
Yes yes. That must be it.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.280
Anyone would get sick of drinking melon soda all the time.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.080
Idiot!

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:13.110
H-Hey! What are you doing?

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:14.460
Isn't it obvious?

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:15.630
I'm throwing them away!

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:19.930
Idiot, stop it! That's my precious collection!

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:23.400
I can't forgive you for drinking a juice other than me!

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:29.850
Wait! What are you doing?

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:34.380
I can't stand you anymore. Stay in there for the rest of your life.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:38.210
Let me out of here! Do you hear me, Kakeru?

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:46.200
Wait, hurry and let me out of here. I'll get lukewarm.

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:51.710
Hey, Kakeru? Right now I can still forgive you. Hey...

00:17:56.690 --> 00:17:59.000
Kakeru... Let me out...

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:02.280
Drink me... Please...

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:18.950
Hey! Have you reflected on your actions?

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:23.490
From now on, you must refer to me as Master.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:27.110
You just need to serve me as a maid for the rest of your life.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.430
Hey.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:50.440
The carbonation is almost gone. It's lukewarm too.

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.600
H-Hey!

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.650
Hey! What's wrong? Hey!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:05.680
There's some juice left, right? Yet why can't she move?

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:07.570
Was it because the carbonation disappeared?

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.640
A-Are you all right?

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:35.330
I... I...

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:36.660
I... I...

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:40.240
Idiot!

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:46.020
You! What were you doing?

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:47.990
What? CPR.

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:52.190
If you buy new juice, I would be okay.

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:57.590
Idiot! Idiot! I really can't believe it.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.730
Really... Real...

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:01.630
Hey.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:06.550
Why? Why did you save me?

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:08.880
Why?

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:14.900
I'm only an empty can, right? Once the can is empty, I just get thrown away.

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:23.650
I'll become trash and get turned into scrap metal at a factory.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:26.620
That's all...

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:28.660
I'm not going to toss you.

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:33.610
Someone like you... Somehow, I just can't leave you.

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:34.920
Kakeru...

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:39.850
Also, I can't throw away a cute girl like you.

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:42.870
From now on, I will train you to my liking!

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.370
Train?

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:49.950
Taming a wild horse is part of being a lady killer.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:53.180
You'll have to listen to me soon, little kitty.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:58.100
That hurt!

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:01.020
What are you thinking?! Pervert!

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:02.880
Wait, Cheesecake!

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:04.450
What, Cheesecake?

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:07.410
It's your name.

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.080
By the way, it's the name of a dog I had before.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:12.620
Don't give me such a weird name!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.070
If you're going to give me one, it should be more-

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:14.870
Melon.

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:18.860
A melon soda can, thus, Melon.

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:21.840
How is it? It's quite a cute name.

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:24.060
Melon?

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:32.030
Seems like you like it. Then, from now on, you are Melon.

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:36.020
Melon-kun! Melon-san! Melon-chan!

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:38.880
Idiot.

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:02.410
In a fragrant mask like that of a prince

00:22:02.560 --> 00:22:04.370
Even if it's only a little bit, my cheeks turn red

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:06.370
Climb up to a place as high as the Andes

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:08.380
Give the snow to my warm heart

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:10.340
